checked animation time advancement, active Niagara, rendered pixels, and
preview release. Screenshots were visually inspected after the final lighting
and particle-framing adjustments. These fixtures do not certify every RX asset
or actual RX ABI/rendering; replacement/restart and the real double-click,
PIE-stop, and re-selection cycle remain live validation steps.

The full offline profile passed all 41 entries, and the inspector ABI guard,
